  "bodyHash": "d3aa9adf1cd2c6da",
  "content": "\n\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>MiiWillisCombatSound</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>MiiWillisCombatSound 专为 Minecraft 的战斗与制作打造！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">通过随你的动作实时变化的动态音效，体验更加沉浸的游戏玩法。无论是挥剑攻击、命中要害造成暴击，还是在工作台制作工具，每一个动作都会伴随令人满意的音效反馈。</p>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>采用本 Mod 的大型整合包</strong></h3>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h1><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1714/660/639090153152096562.png\" alt=\"Modded Together 标志\" width=\"230\" height=\"230\">&nbsp;</h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/moddedtogether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Modded Together </strong></a><strong>&nbsp;</strong></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pitersonix/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Pitersonix</a></strong></h3>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1750/568/639114189887918535.webp\" alt=\"Restless Horizons 标志\" width=\"229\" height=\"229\"></strong></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/restlesshorizons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Restless Horizons</strong></a></h1>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lyzerrah/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lyzerrah</a></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Lyzerrah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>YouTube</strong></a></h3>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>你可能也熟悉来自以下 Mod 的音效</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-combat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Immersive Combat (1.12 Better Combat) [原版音效]</a></strong></h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>或出自整合包 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/rlcraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">RLCRAFT</a></strong></h3>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>致谢与来源</strong></h3>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感谢 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/burgggy/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">burgggy&nbsp;</a> 提供可使用的战斗音效</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">感谢 Pixabay 提供制作相关的音效素材</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">（Pixabay 的音效已进行编辑处理）</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>无冲突 &bull; 零性能损耗</strong></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fraw.githubusercontent.com%252fMiiWilli%252fMiiWillisCombatSound%252frefs%252fheads%252fmain%252fLICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MIT 许可证</a>&nbsp;&ndash; 允许用于任何整合包、修改及重新分发</strong></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>兼容性：</strong></h3>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>✅</strong> <strong>MoBends</strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>✅ Better Combat</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>✅ Spirit of Fight&nbsp;</strong><br><strong>❓ &nbsp;Epic Fight &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>尚未完全针对 EpicFight 进行适配开发&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(<em>需进行部分调整方可完美运行</em>)</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>本 Mod 支持所有模组武器与物品的音效替换</strong></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>说明</strong></h3>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Immersive Tools And Weapons Sounds [FORGE]</strong> 该 Mod 无法在服务器端加载，且原作者已停止维护，因此本作可作为替代方案。<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superior-ambience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Superior Ambience</strong></a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/superior-combat-sounds\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Superior Combat Sounds</strong></a> 也可作为 1.20.1 Forge 版本的备选。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1355253/description_b17fd3a7-8681-43c7-b0cb-9cd467938d32.PNG\" alt=\"\" width=\"824\" height=\"194\"></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Mod 版本 (MiiWillisCombatSound)</strong></h3>\n<div>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(1.16.5 Forge)✅ v0.0.1</strong></div>\n<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><del style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(1.19.2 Forge 移植版) ⚪ 即将推出...</strong></del></span>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(1.20.1 Forge)✅</strong></div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>(1.21.1 Neoforge)✅</strong></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n<div><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a91d5422-0c1c-4fbd-836f-c503a10507a9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"360\" height=\"360\"></strong></div>\n</div>\n<div><strong>&nbsp;</strong></div>",
